    "summary": "The product is a Fastrack digital quartz wristwatch featuring a ruggedized resin casing with decorative external stainless steel accent screws. The design uses high-volume injection-molded polymer components for the bezel, case, and inner dial frame, coupled with a compression-molded flexible silicone strap. The internal quartz movement drives a custom multi-segment LCD displaying time, date, and mode indicators. Modular elements such as the strap and battery/caseback allow straightforward servicing, whereas internal display assembly requires complete replacement of the core digital module."
